{"title": "Binance Resumes Crypto Withdrawals After $6.3 Billion Heist", "summary": "Cryptocurrency exchange Binance has resumed withdrawals for 15 cryptocurrencies after a heist that saw approximately $6.3 billion stolen. The exchange stated it used its own funds to cover about 95% of the stolen assets. Following the resumption of withdrawals, Binance saw net outflows of $3.64 billion. The FBI has blamed North Korea for the hack, which is described as the biggest crypto heist in history.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "बिनेंस ने 6.3 अरब डॉलर की चोरी के बाद क्रिप्टो निकासी फिर से शुरू की", "summary_hi": "क्रिप्टोकरेंसी एक्सचेंज बिनेंस ने 15 क्रिप्टोकरेंसी के लिए निकासी फिर से शुरू कर दी है, जो लगभग 6.3 अरब डॉलर की चोरी के बाद हुई है। एक्सचेंज ने कहा कि उसने चोरी हुई संपत्ति का लगभग 95% कवर करने के लिए अपने स्वयं के धन का उपयोग किया। निकासी फिर से शुरू होने के बाद, बिनेंस ने 3.64 अरब डॉलर का शुद्ध बहिर्वाह देखा। एफबीआई ने इस हैक के लिए उत्तर कोरिया को जिम्मेदार ठहराया है, जिसे इतिहास की सबसे बड़ी क्रिप्टो चोरी बताया गया है।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Highlights the FBI's attribution of the hack to North Korea, describing it as the biggest crypto heist in history."], "center": ["Reports Binance's resumption of withdrawals after covering 95% of the $6.3 billion stolen assets.", "Notes that Binance experienced net outflows of $3.64 billion after withdrawals resumed.", "Mentions the hack occurred, leading to a fall in cryptocurrency prices."], "right": ["Emphasizes Binance's phased withdrawal resumption and its recovery of 95% of stolen tokens following the $6.3 billion heist."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["हैकिंग के लिए उत्तर कोरिया को जिम्मेदार ठहराने वाली एफबीआई पर प्रकाश डालता है, इसे इतिहास की सबसे बड़ी क्रिप्टो चोरी बताता है।"], "center": ["बिनेंस द्वारा चोरी की गई 6.3 अरब डॉलर की संपत्ति का 95% कवर करने के बाद निकासी फिर से शुरू करने की रिपोर्ट करता है।", "नोट करता है कि निकासी फिर से शुरू होने के बाद बिनेंस ने 3.64 अरब डॉलर का शुद्ध बहिर्वाह देखा।", "उल्लेख करता है कि हैक हुआ, जिससे क्रिप्टोकरेंसी की कीमतों में गिरावट आई।"], "right": ["6.3 अरब डॉलर की चोरी के बाद बिनेंस के चरणबद्ध निकासी फिर से शुरू होने और चोरी हुए टोकन का 95% ठीक होने पर जोर देता है।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2026/11/01/1600x900/logo/binance_179332269641_1793536666050_rfDa_1793536666207_WAKK_5e089e04-f982-47e2-8aec-6392a549b988_bwX0.png", "sources": [{"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/binance-resumes-bitcoin-ether-withdrawals-after-recovering-95-of-6-3-billion-in-crypto-theft-check-details-11793533925706.html", "headline": "Binance resumes bitcoin, ether withdrawals after recovering 95% of $6.3 billion in crypto theft; check details", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/binance-resumes-withdrawals-days-after-hack-that-wiped-out-6-billion-12266847", "headline": "Binance Resumes Withdrawals Days After Hack That Wiped Out $6 Billion", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "Business Standard", "owner": "Business Standard", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Binance hack exposes unsolvable crypto risk: Billions can vanish overnight", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "Firstpost", "owner": "Network18", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Binance begins phased withdrawal resumption after $6.3 billion crypto heist, replaces 95% of stolen tokens", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "BBC News", "owner": "BBC News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwj34gdmnly4o", "headline": "Binance users withdraw $3.6bn after record crypto hack", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "BBC News", "owner": "BBC News", "lea